{"about_the_game":"Caution: This is not Bird Game 3!!<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/5ae5dc1e74f74ec7332c033635ecc3cd.avif?t=1768986042\" width=620 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Tiny Birdtopia</i>, your PC desktop isn\u2019t just your workspace\u2014but your very own bird sanctuary! Whether you\u2019re in a meeting, drafting a report, or browsing the web, you can effortlessly manage your feathered paradise. Collect and nurture birds, unlock hidden species, and customize your birdtopia to your heart\u2019s content\u2014turn every work break into a chorus of birdsong!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/d80372b4462f7390608f9265d30c8fc7.avif?t=1768986042\" width=620 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bird boasts its own unique plumage\u2014gather their feathers to unlock secret, rare species! Explore the in-game <i>Birddex</i> to learn about each bird\u2019s habits, habitats, and even listen to their distinctive calls. Whether you\u2019re looking for a moment of calm or you\u2019re a dedicated bird enthusiast, Tiny Birdtopia is the perfect pick-me-up between tasks!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/1af45cf5fb13357e6d6c87d57ab0daa7.avif?t=1768986042\" width=620 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a relaxing idle game, your birds will grow over time while you focus on your work\u2014just sit back and watch them thrive!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839360?t=1768986042","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app