ex</i> to learn about each bird\u2019s habits, habitats, and even listen to their distinctive calls. Whether you\u2019re looking for a moment of calm or you\u2019re a dedicated bird enthusiast, Tiny Birdtopia is the perfect pick-me-up between tasks!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/1af45cf5fb13357e6d6c87d57ab0daa7.avif?t=1768986042\" width=620 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a relaxing idle game, your birds will grow over time while you focus on your work\u2014just sit back and watch them thrive!</p>","developers":["Burning Star"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/daab4ed18a2ed4c2fd5818671c9abb3bd0ed5803/header.jpg?t=1768986042","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Tiny Birdtopia","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5Ghz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 750</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5Ghz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 950</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Burning Star"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"d